      "description": "Dark-theme primary face uses Action, while readable detail and focus use their own theme roles.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary-dark\" type=\"button\">Download</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary-dark{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;isolation:isolate;width:280px;min-height:52px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #CB2D42;border-radius:8px;background:#CB2D42;color:#FFF;font:600 17px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary-dark::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;z-index:-1;inset:0;border-radius:7px;background:#FFF;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 100ms cubic-bezier(.333333,1,.666667,1)}.ds-primary-dark:hover::before{opacity:.08;transition-duration:130ms}.ds-primary-dark:active{border-color:#F6F2F4}.ds-primary-dark:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #F6F2F4;outline-offset:-2px}.ds-primary-dark:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}.ds-primary-dark:disabled::before{opacity:0}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary-dark::before{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Native outlined field-face action, with tonal hover/press and a visible focus boundary.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\" type=\"button\">Open folder</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;isolation:isolate;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #8E7D87;border-radius:8px;background:#FFF;color:#272329;font:14px/22px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-secondary::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;z-index:-1;inset:0;border-radius:7px;background:#F3E9ED;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 100ms cubic-bezier(.333333,1,.666667,1)}.ds-secondary:hover::before{opacity:1;transition-duration:130ms}.ds-secondary:active{background:#F8E3E9}.ds-secondary:active::before{opacity:0}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #A91F33;outline-offset:-2px}.ds-secondary:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}.ds-secondary:disabled::before{opacity:0}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary::before{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quiet action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-quiet",
      "description": "Transparent secondary emphasis for optional actions and supporting commands.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-quiet\" type=\"button\">Choose videos</button>",
      "css": ".ds-quiet{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;isolation:isolate;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#A91F33;font:14px/22px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-quiet::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;z-index:-1;inset:0;border-radius:7px;background:#F3E9ED;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 100ms cubic-bezier(.333333,1,.666667,1)}.ds-quiet:hover::before{opacity:1;transition-duration:130ms}.ds-quiet:active{background:#F8E3E9}.ds-quiet:active::before{opacity:0}.ds-quiet:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #A91F33;outline-offset:-2px}.ds-quiet:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}.ds-quiet:disabled::before{opacity:0}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-quiet::before{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Link field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Literal-LTR native link input, translated to a full-width HTML input for preview.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-link\" type=\"url\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-label=\"Video or playlist link\" placeholder=\"Paste a video or playlist link\">",
      "css": ".ds-link{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:44px;padding:5px 12px;border:1px solid #8E7D87;border-radius:8px;background:#FFF;color:#272329;caret-color:#A91F33;font:14px/22px Inter,sans-serif}.ds-link::placeholder{color:#655963}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#A91F33}.ds-link::selection{background:#F8E3E9}.ds-link:disabled{opacity:.55}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected output segment",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "format-selected",
      "description": "The same selected face serves Video and Audio; labels and distinct icons carry mode meaning.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-segment\" type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1 4H12V15H1ZM12 7L18 4V15L12 12\"/></svg>Video · MP4</button>",
      "css": ".ds-segment{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;isolation:isolate;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:46px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #A91F33;border-radius:8px;background:#F8E3E9;color:#A91F33;font:600 14px/22px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-segment svg{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-segment::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;z-index:-1;inset:0;border-radius:7px;background:#F3E9ED;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 100ms cubic-bezier(.333333,1,.666667,1)}.ds-segment:hover::before{opacity:.35;transition-duration:130ms}.ds-segment:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #A91F33;outline-offset:-2px}.ds-segment:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}.ds-segment:disabled::before{opacity:0}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-segment::before{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Language choices",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "language-menu",
      "description": "Two equal button faces in the quieter language frame; selected check stays physically left.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-language\" aria-label=\"Language\"><button class=\"ds-language-row ds-language-current\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 10L7 15L18 3\"/></svg><span>English</span><i></i></button><button class=\"ds-language-row\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i></i><span lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العربية</span><i></i></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-language{box-sizing:border-box;width:160px;padding:4px;border:1px solid #DFD7DC;border-radius:8px;background:#F1EDF0}.ds-language-row{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;isolation:isolate;display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr 18px;align-items:center;direction:ltr;gap:8px;width:100%;height:40px;margin:0 0 4px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #DFD7DC;border-radius:8px;background:#FFF;color:#272329;font:14px/22px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-language-row:last-child{margin:0}.ds-language-row span{text-align:center}.ds-language-row span[lang=ar]{font-family:\"Noto Sans Arabic\",sans-serif}.ds-language-row svg{fill:none;stroke:#A91F33;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-language-current{background:#F8E3E9;border-color:#A91F33;font-weight:600}.ds-language-row:hover{border-color:#A91F33}.ds-language-row:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#272329}.ds-language-row:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Flat media context",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "media-surface",
      "description": "Shared Page ground with bounded media title, quiet supporting text and a Divider; example copy is illustrative.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-media\" aria-label=\"Media context\"><p class=\"ds-media-label\">Media details</p><h2 class=\"ds-media-title\">Inspected media title</h2><p class=\"ds-media-subtitle\">Source details</p><hr class=\"ds-media-divider\"><p class=\"ds-media-label\">Output</p><p class=\"ds-media-output\">Video · MP4</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-media{box-sizing:border-box;padding:24px 30px;background:#F8F7F8;color:#272329;font:14px/22px Inter,sans-serif}.ds-media-label{margin:0 0 18px;color:#655963}.ds-media-title{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;margin:0;font:600 23px/32px Inter,sans-serif}.ds-media-subtitle{margin:9px 0 0;color:#655963}.ds-media-divider{height:1px;margin:22px 0 20px;border:0;background:#DFD7DC}.ds-media-output{margin:5px 0 16px}"
    },
